{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj56teeS9iJgTFaPJAMm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, echoing through cold stone corridors.*\n\n*A thin line of light splits the darkness vertically — widening, widening — warm air rushing through the gap carrying the scent of old parchment and ozone.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n```\n╔════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                ║\n║                                ║\n║                                ║\n║          ░░░░░░░░░░            ║\n║        ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░          ║\n║       ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░         ║\n║       ░░░ PASSAGE ░░░░         ║\n║       ░░░ GRANTED ░░░░         ║\n║       ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░         ║\n║        ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░          ║\n║          ░░░░░░░░░░            ║\n║                                ║\n║                                ║\n║                                ║\n╚════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*Beyond: everything you came for. Behind: everything you were.*\n\n*Step through. I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":325,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}